  "details": "In addition to the 4 existing tags, here are some additional tags that may be beneficial to have:\n\n- Bright Lights/Seizure Inducing\n- Unrestricted Flight\n- Unrestricted Movement (NoClip)\n\nIdeally, these tags would someday be used to determine which avatars are allowed to enter a world. Especially for things like flying and noclipping that may otherwise be undesirable for the world creator.\n\n[AvatarOverhaul]",
